  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solomon Islands Election Support 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A multi-faceted, targeted election support package, developed in coordination with Australia and UNDP.
&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Funding to Solomon Islands Electoral Commission for&#xA0;core election preparation &amp;amp; delivery;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;NZDF logistics support, including deployment of assets &amp;amp; personnel to transport observers &amp;amp; ballot boxes;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Costs associated with technical support by New&#xA0;Zealand Electoral Commission,&#xA0; e.g. voting screens, an HR information system for managing the large temporary election workforce;&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;Election observers.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
